    "content": "```c++\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>   \n#include <algorithm>\nusing namespace std;\n\nvoid bubble_sort(vector<int> &arr) \n{\n    int len = arr.size();\n    for (int i = 0; i < len - 1; i++) {\n        for (int j = 0; j < len - 1 - i; j++) {\n            if (arr[j] > arr[j + 1]) {\n                swap(arr[j], arr[j + 1]);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nint main() \n{\n    vector<int> arr = { 61, 17, 29, 22, 34, 60, 72, 21, 50, 1, 62 };\n    \n    bubble_sort(arr);\n    \n    for (int x : arr) {\n        cout << x << ' ';\n    }\n    cout << endl;\n    \n    return 0;\n}\n\n```\n<details>\n<summary>複雜度？</summary>\n\t$$\n\tO(n^2)\n\t$$\n</details>\n<empty-block/>"
